        <mxCell id="c70" value="&lt;i&gt;Receivables: the ledger 4,798,804.32 is the open invoices 4,418,804.32 and the opening line 380,000.00. Payables: the ledger 6,237,466.66 is the open invoices 4,781,095.54 and the opening payables 2,096,371.12, less 640,000.00 for the two invoices the ledger moved to notes payable while the subledger still lists them open, drawn below the axis. The dashed line is the ledger balance. The dispositions are those of the Findings table.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="436" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
